tici_defconfig: 关 CONFIG_PANIC_ON_RT_THROTTLING

RT 节流触发时退化为上游默认的节流 + 日志，不再 BUG() 重启（AGNOS 普查 §1.11）。

--- a/arch/arm64/configs/tici_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/tici_defconfig
@@ -5238,7 +5238,7 @@
 CONFIG_SCHED_DEBUG=n
 CONFIG_SCHED_INFO=n
 CONFIG_PANIC_ON_SCHED_BUG=y
-CONFIG_PANIC_ON_RT_THROTTLING=y
+# CONFIG_PANIC_ON_RT_THROTTLING is not set
 CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS=n
 CONFIG_SCHED_STACK_END_CHECK=n
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_TIMEKEEPING is not set
